// Prepare n8n API request to fetch recent executions
const baseUrl = $env.N8N_HOST || 'https://mmurawala.app.n8n.cloud';
const now = new Date();
const fiveMinAgo = new Date(now - 5 * 60 * 1000);

return [{
  json: {
    url: `${baseUrl}/api/v1/executions`,
    params: {
      status: 'all',
      limit: 250,
      startedAfter: fiveMinAgo.toISOString(),
      startedBefore: now.toISOString()
    },
    timestamp: now.toISOString()
  }
}];

// Aggregate execution metrics
const executions = $input.all();
const now = new Date();
const fiveMinAgo = new Date(now - 5 * 60 * 1000);

const metrics = {
  period: { start: fiveMinAgo.toISOString(), end: now.toISOString() },
  total_executions: executions.length,
  successful: 0,
  failed: 0,
  running: 0,
  avg_duration_ms: 0,
  by_workflow: {},
  error_rate: 0
};

let totalDuration = 0;
for (const exec of executions) {
  const e = exec.json;
  if (e.status === 'success') metrics.successful++;
  else if (e.status === 'error') metrics.failed++;
  else if (e.status === 'running') metrics.running++;

  if (e.stoppedAt && e.startedAt) {
    totalDuration += new Date(e.stoppedAt) - new Date(e.startedAt);
  }

  const wfName = e.workflowName || 'unknown';
  if (!metrics.by_workflow[wfName]) {
    metrics.by_workflow[wfName] = { total: 0, success: 0, failed: 0 };
  }
  metrics.by_workflow[wfName].total++;
  if (e.status === 'success') metrics.by_workflow[wfName].success++;
  if (e.status === 'error') metrics.by_workflow[wfName].failed++;
}

metrics.avg_duration_ms = metrics.total_executions > 0 ? Math.round(totalDuration / metrics.total_executions) : 0;
metrics.error_rate = metrics.total_executions > 0 ? (metrics.failed / metrics.total_executions * 100).toFixed(2) + '%' : '0%';

return [{ json: metrics }];

// Format metrics for storage and downstream consumption
const metrics = $input.first().json;

const storageRecord = {
  _id: `metrics_${Date.now()}`,
  _timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),
  _type: 'execution_metrics',
  _version: '1.0',

  period_start: metrics.period.start,
  period_end: metrics.period.end,
  total_executions: metrics.total_executions,
  successful: metrics.successful,
  failed: metrics.failed,
  running: metrics.running,
  avg_duration_ms: metrics.avg_duration_ms,
  error_rate: metrics.error_rate,
  by_workflow: metrics.by_workflow,

  // Parsed error rate as number for threshold comparison
  error_rate_numeric: parseFloat(metrics.error_rate) || 0
};

return [{ json: storageRecord }];

